[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2524.87, "timestamp": "00:42:04", "text": "嗯，那是敵方直升機嗎？  媽的。  我的天啊。敵人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2540.309, "timestamp": "00:42:20", "text": "雅達。我只是個優步司機"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2543.43, "timestamp": "00:42:23", "text": "。  我是你的優步。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2561.109, "timestamp": "00:42:41", "text": "好了，我們返回基地。"}]